      "widgets_values": ["# FLUX.2 Dev LoRA — Nine Dating Scenes\n\nThis workflow is locked to the trained **FLUX.2 Dev v2 step-1000 LoRA**, not the Klein adapter, and the batch runs on the **RTX 3090**.\n\n- Base: `flux2_dev_fp8mixed.safetensors`\n- LoRA: `m1tch-flux2-dev-identity-v2-s1000.safetensors`\n- LoRA hash: `7c0c4f1726189c51e19c8392c12fe3e03a26bd084fffb8d84b907c966a77cc3e`\n- Trigger: `m1tch_person`\n- Default: strength 1.1, Euler, 28 steps, guidance 4.0\n\nChoose one of the nine `mitch-workbench-dating-*` scene images. Picture 1 supplies composition, pose, clothes, props and lighting. The Dev LoRA supplies Mitch's identity. In group scenes, only the primary man should be Mitch.\n\nThe supplied batch runner is `scripts/run-flux2-dev-lora-nine-scenes-3090.ps1`."],
